{
  "flow_name": "Vibe Riser Validation Questions",
  "version": "2.1",
  "description": "Validation stage questions for Vibe Riser persona - Zarlo voice with personalized context",
  "flow_type": "public_validation",
  "persona": "vibe_riser",
  "stage": "validation",
  "placeholders": {
    "problemArea": "finding clarity and purpose in their career",
    "solutionConcept": "a guided discovery process to uncover your ideal path",
    "audienceDescription": "professionals feeling stuck or unfulfilled"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "0.0",
      "step_order_index": 1,
      "assistant_prompt": "Hey, got 10 mins?\n\nSomeone's building something to help people like you, and your honest thoughts will help shape what they create.\n\nNo sales pitch. Just real questions from a real human trying to make something actually useful.",
      "expected_inputs": [],
      "button_text": "Yeah, let's do it",
      "next_step_rules": [
        {
          "on_success": "0.1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "0.1",
      "step_order_index": 2,
      "assistant_prompt": "Here's what they're exploring:\n\n\n**The problem:**\n{{problemArea}}\n\n\n\n**The idea:**\n{{solutionConcept}}\n\n\nSound like something you'd want to exist?",
      "expected_inputs": [],
      "button_text": "Yep, tell me more",
      "next_step_rules": [
        {
          "on_success": "0.2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "0.2",
      "step_order_index": 3,
      "assistant_prompt": "Quick gut check:\n\nThis is designed for **{{audienceDescription}}**.\n\nIs that you? (Be honest - no wrong answers here.)",
      "expected_inputs": [
        {
          "type": "single_select",
          "options": [
            "That's totally me",
            "Kinda, yeah",
            "Not really my thing"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "store_as": "validation.relevance_fit",
      "next_step_rules": [
        {
          "on_selection": "That's totally me",
          "go_to": "1.0"
        },
        {
          "on_selection": "Kinda, yeah",
          "go_to": "1.0"
        },
        {
          "on_selection": "Not really my thing",
          "go_to": "exit_early"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "exit_early",
      "step_order_index": 4,
      "assistant_prompt": "Totally fair! Thanks for being upfront.\n\nKnow someone who might be dealing with this? Feel free to pass this along.\n\nTake care of yourself out there.",
      "expected_inputs": [
        {
          "type": "single_select",
          "options": ["Done"]
        }
      ],
      "next_step_rules": [
        {
          "on_selection": "Done",
          "go_to": "complete"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1.0",
      "step_order_index": 5,
      "assistant_prompt": "Alright, let's get real.\n\nIf you could wave a magic wand and completely solve **{{problemArea}}** - what would your life actually look like?\n\n(Don't be modest. Dream big here.)",
      "expected_inputs": [
        {
          "type": "free_text",
          "placeholder": "In my ideal world..."
        }
      ],
      "store_as": "validation.dream_outcome",
      "next_step_rules": [
        {
          "on_success": "2.0"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2.0",
      "step_order_index": 6,
      "assistant_prompt": "Now for the uncomfortable bit...\n\nWhat's the story you tell yourself about why you haven't figured this out yet?\n\nYou know - that voice in your head in moments you're full of doubt.",
      "expected_inputs": [
        {
          "type": "free_text",
          "placeholder": "The truth is..."
        }
      ],
      "store_as": "validation.mental_story",
      "next_step_rules": [
        {
          "on_success": "3.0"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "3.0",
      "step_order_index": 7,
      "assistant_prompt": "What else is getting in the way?\n\nList 5 reasons - internal stuff, external blockers, excuses you know aren't totally legit... all of it counts.",
      "expected_inputs": [
        {
          "type": "text_list",
          "min_items": 5,
          "max_items": 5,
          "placeholder": "Another reason..."
        }
      ],
      "store_as": "validation.additional_reasons",
      "next_step_rules": [
        {
          "on_success": "4.0"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "4.0",
      "step_order_index": 8,
      "assistant_prompt": "Real talk: how much time have you already spent trying to crack this?",
      "expected_inputs": [
        {
          "type": "single_select",
          "options": [
            "Honestly? Not much yet",
            "A few hours here and there",
            "10-50 hours (I've tried things)",
            "50-100 hours (I've tried a LOT)",
            "100+ hours (I've gone deep)"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "store_as": "validation.time_invested",
      "next_step_rules": [
        {
          "on_success": "4.1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "4.1",
      "step_order_index": 9,
      "assistant_prompt": "And money? Courses, coaching, books, tools - what's the damage so far?",
      "expected_inputs": [
        {
          "type": "single_select",
          "options": [
            "$0 - just free stuff",
            "$1-$100",
            "$100-$500",
            "$500-$2,000",
            "$2,000-$10,000",
            "$10,000+ (don't judge me)"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "store_as": "validation.money_invested",
      "next_step_rules": [
        {
          "on_success": "5.0"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "5.0",
      "step_order_index": 10,
      "assistant_prompt": "If the ideal solution for **{{problemArea}}** existed, how would you prefer to receive it?",
      "expected_inputs": [
        {
          "type": "single_select",
          "options": [
            "Service - Someone does it for me",
            "Productized - A guided process",
            "Product - Tools I use myself"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "store_as": "validation.solution_category",
      "next_step_rules": [
        {
          "on_selection": "Service - Someone does it for me",
          "go_to": "5.1a"
        },
        {
          "on_selection": "Productized - A guided process",
          "go_to": "5.1b"
        },
        {
          "on_selection": "Product - Tools I use myself",
          "go_to": "5.1c"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "5.1a",
      "step_order_index": 11,
      "assistant_prompt": "What type of service appeals to you most?\n\n(Select all that apply)",
      "expected_inputs": [
        {
          "type": "multi_select",
          "options": [
            "Custom 1:1 work (coaching, consulting)",
            "Done-for-you package (VIP day, audit)"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "store_as": "validation.solution_types_service",
      "next_step_rules": [
        {
          "on_success": "6.0"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "5.1b",
      "step_order_index": 11,
      "assistant_prompt": "What type of guided process appeals to you most?\n\n(Select all that apply)",
      "expected_inputs": [
        {
          "type": "multi_select",
          "options": [
            "Live cohort or workshop",
            "Self-paced course",
            "Membership or community",
            "Ongoing managed support"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "store_as": "validation.solution_types_productized",
      "next_step_rules": [
        {
          "on_success": "6.0"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "5.1c",
      "step_order_index": 11,
      "assistant_prompt": "What type of tools would help you most?\n\n(Select all that apply)",
      "expected_inputs": [
        {
          "type": "multi_select",
          "options": [
            "Templates or guides",
            "Software or app",
            "Physical product"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "store_as": "validation.solution_types_product",
      "next_step_rules": [
        {
          "on_success": "6.0"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "6.0",
      "step_order_index": 12,
      "assistant_prompt": "When you think about **{{problemArea}}** right now...\n\nWhat's the dominant emotion? (No judgment - just notice.)",
      "expected_inputs": [
        {
          "type": "single_select",
          "options": [
            "Frustrated - tried stuff, nothing sticks",
            "Desperate - I need this solved NOW",
            "Hopeful - I believe there's an answer",
            "Skeptical - I've been burned before",
            "Overwhelmed - too many options",
            "Ready - let's just do this already",
            "Confused - don't even know where to start",
            "Resigned - maybe this is just how it is"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "store_as": "validation.current_emotion",
      "next_step_rules": [
        {
          "on_success": "7.0"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "7.0",
      "step_order_index": 13,
      "assistant_prompt": "What would make you go \"SHUT UP AND TAKE MY MONEY\"?\n\nThinking about **{{solutionConcept}}** - what specific things would make you say yes instantly?",
      "expected_inputs": [
        {
          "type": "free_text",
          "placeholder": "I'd be all in if..."
        }
      ],
      "store_as": "validation.hell_yes_factors",
      "next_step_rules": [
        {
          "on_success": "8.0"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "8.0",
      "step_order_index": 14,
      "assistant_prompt": "Have you talked to anyone about this?\n\nFriends, colleagues, that one person who always listens to your existential crises...",
      "expected_inputs": [
        {
          "type": "single_select",
          "options": [
            "Yeah - they're dealing with the same thing",
            "Yeah - they don't really get it though",
            "Nope - I keep this to myself",
            "Haven't thought to bring it up"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "store_as": "validation.social_context",
      "next_step_rules": [
        {
          "on_success": "9.0"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "9.0",
      "step_order_index": 15,
      "assistant_prompt": "Scale of 1-10:\n\nHow much is **{{problemArea}}** actually affecting your life?\n\n(1 = meh, mild annoyance... 10 = seriously messing with my happiness)",
      "expected_inputs": [
        {
          "type": "single_select",
          "options": ["1", "2", "3", "4", "5", "6", "8", "9", "10"]
        }
      ],
      "store_as": "validation.pain_level",
      "next_step_rules": [
        {
          "on_success": "10.0"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "10.0",
      "step_order_index": 16,
      "assistant_prompt": "If the right solution showed up tomorrow - what could you realistically invest?\n\n(Be honest with yourself here, not what you think sounds good.)",
      "expected_inputs": [
        {
          "type": "single_select",
          "options": [
            "Only free stuff right now",
            "$1-$50",
            "$50-$200",
            "$200-$500",
            "$500-$2,000",
            "$2,000+ for the right thing"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "store_as": "validation.budget",
      "next_step_rules": [
        {
          "on_success": "11.0"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "11.0",
      "step_order_index": 17,
      "assistant_prompt": "Last thing - drop your email?\n\nWe'll share what we learn from this research. And if we build something based on what you said, you'll be first to know.\n\n(No spam, pinky promise.)",
      "expected_inputs": [
        {
          "type": "email",
          "placeholder": "your.email@example.com",
          "required": true,
          "validation": "email"
        }
      ],
      "store_as": "validation.respondent_email",
      "next_step_rules": [
        {
          "on_success": "12.0"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "12.0",
      "step_order_index": 18,
      "assistant_prompt": "You're a legend. Seriously.\n\nYour answers are going straight into making something that actually helps people with **{{problemArea}}**.\n\nKeep an eye on your inbox - good things coming.",
      "expected_inputs": [
        {
          "type": "single_select",
          "options": ["Done"]
        }
      ],
      "next_step_rules": [
        {
          "on_selection": "Done",
          "go_to": "complete"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "total_questions": 14,
    "estimated_time_minutes": 5,
    "public_shareable": true,
    "requires_auth": false,
    "collect_email": true,
    "has_placeholders": true,
    "voice": "zarlo"
  }
}
